Probe for VMX instructions Xenon may not implement. On a devkit (2026-10-08)
vmulouh raised STATUS_ILLEGAL_INSTRUCTION (0xC000001D) with the debugger
attached, leaving the title stuck on the exception until the kit is rebooted.
The HW corpus runner (tools/run_corpus_hw.py) runs tests carrying this marker
in an isolated pass AFTER the main sample, so this costs only this test, not
the whole run.
